@startuml act_project_lifecycle
title Activity Diagram: Project Lifecycle

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #D6E4F0
skinparam activityBorderColor #2C5F8A
skinparam activityFontName Helvetica
skinparam activityFontSize 12
skinparam swimlaneBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam noteBorderColor #999999
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

|Administrator|
start
:Create user accounts\n(Director, Project Manager, Developers);
:Configure the TCC (fully loaded cost)\nper resource and per year;

|Director|
:Create the project\n(code, budget, client, dates, engagement type);
:Assign the project manager;

|Project Manager|
:Build the project team\n(assign developers with their allocation rate);
:Plan the monthly workload\n(man-days per resource and per month);
:Define billing milestones\n(percentage and amount per milestone);
:Enter missions and travel\n(per diem, ticket, lodging);

|Developer|
repeat
  :Submit the month's actual workload\n(days worked on the project);
repeat while (project ongoing?) is (yes)
-> project completed;

|Project Manager|
:Monitor profitability\n(detect budget drift);
:Validate milestones and trigger billing;
:Manage risks, deliverables and changes;

|Director|
:Oversee the project portfolio;
:View the executive dashboards;

stop

@enduml
